  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Declan Donovan. I'm on Malbone Road, 365, up the North End. It's the dead end, past where the bank used to be, you turn in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 365 Malbone. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We got a dusting overnight, and with this cold it's just sitting there, packed down. Nobody's been down the street. I know a dead end gets plowed last, that's always how it goes. I just want to know when it'll get cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right, dead ends are last on the route. With only a dusting they're doing the main roads first. Figure sometime this afternoon, maybe into the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Sorry if I sound like I'm out of breath. I switched to a standing desk and I'm pacing the whole call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Want me to note it on the list for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. 365 Malbone Road. My number's 401-555-0161 if they need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0161. It's noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T12:28:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. Take care."
    }
  ],
